/A 1397 0 R
/Alt (The four-panel flowchart details the LOCA spatial prediction of precipitation. Panel 1, Data download and preprocess, shows icons for precipitation, temperature, and wind, leading to feature selection and variable overlay. Panel 2, Local outliers for context-aware LOCA in modelling precipitation, has three subpanels. Panel 2a, Identify local outliers, shows positive and negative outlier detection. Panel 2b, Feature-based stratification, shows K-means, GMM, and Spectral methods. Panel 2c, Local context-aware modelling, shows overall modelling branching to RF, LR, SVR, XGBoost, and KNN, leading to model selection and predictions. Panel 3, Spatial prediction, shows two pathways: one with local outliers added and one without, both leading to spatial prediction. Panel 4, Model validation, shows model evaluation and analysis of outlier contribution.)
