/Alt (The six panel scatter plot shows predicted versus observed precipitation in millimetres. Panels a, b, and c display K-means stratified context aware ML, GMM stratified context aware ML, and Spectral stratified context aware ML models, respectively. Panels d, e, and f show K-means stratified LOCA, GMM stratified LOCA, and Spectral stratified LOCA models, respectively. Each panel plots Observation of Precipitation in millimetres on the horizontal axis from 0 to 800 and Prediction of Precipitation in millimetres on the vertical axis from 0 to 800. A dashed diagonal line indicates perfect agreement. In all panels, data points generally cluster along this diagonal line, indicating a positive correlation between observed and predicted values. Panel a has an R squared value of 0.797. Panel b has an R squared value of 0.791. Panel c has an R squared value of 0.779. Panel d has an R squared value of 0.850. Panel e has an R squared value of 0.858. Panel f has an R squared value of 0.846. The LOCA models in panels d, e, and f generally show higher R squared values compared to the context aware ML models in panels a, b, and c, indicating a stronger correlation for the LOCA models.)
